OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,6,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,7,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,8,     GToday, a new chapter for
OL,9,     GDonizetti as he moves to Paris in
OL,10,     Gsearch of artistic freedom.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GLive performance by Anna
OL,13,     GLowenstein and her quartet to
OL,14,     Gpromote their album Through The
OL,15,     GWalls. Susan Tomes talks to Katie
OL,16,     Gabout her new book Nocturnes and
OL,17,     Gthe Fascination of Night.
